, "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Explore the dark marine abysses in AquaDream, a captivating puzzle game. Take on the role of a brave anglerfish and solve complex puzzles in the heart of underwater labyrinths. Find hidden keys, activate towers to open new passages, and follow ocean currents precisely to avoid deadly traps.\nBut that's not all! Collect a variety of rare shells scattered throughout the levels to complete your personal collection. Each shell collected brings you one step closer to becoming the master of the depths.\nChallenging puzzles in an immersive marine environment\nLabyrinths to explore and secret passages to discover\nKeys and towers to activate for progress\nTraps to avoid and ocean currents to follow\nA collection of rare shells to complete\nAre you ready to take on the challenge and uncover the hidden secrets of the marine depths?"}